     The rraaddiiuussdd__ssttaannddaarrdd utility is executed by radiusd(8) as a module to
     provide various standard functionalities.  It can be configured as a mod‐
     ule for decoration which modifies request and response RADIUS messages.
     Also it can be configured as an accounting module that logs accounting
     information through syslog(3).

